---
// "Wizzzee" with its three z's in the treemap's first colours, as the promo video draws it.
---
<span class="wordmark" aria-label="Wizzzee">Wi<span class="z1">z</span><span class="z2">z</span><span class="z3">z</span>ee</span>
<style>
  .wordmark { font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .z1 { color: var(--z1); }
  .z2 { color: var(--z2); }
  .z3 { color: var(--z3); }
</style>
